{
  "name": "Personal Finance Autopilot \u2014 Siva",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Personal Finance Autopilot \u2014 Siva\nBank/Stripe webhook + weekly schedule \u2192 Gemini categorises transactions, flags unusual spend, updates the Sheet dashboard \u2192 weekly summary email with GENERIC budgeting advice only. No real bank credentials \u2014 webhook payload only, placeholders everywhere.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "043fe593-defd-4fb4-ad6c-1026b331c15a",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2014 Flow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "MEMORY LAYER (no live DB): the Finance sheet is the memory \u2014 Transactions tab (every categorised transaction) + Dashboard tab (monthly totals by category). Gemini / the weekly summary read past rows for averages. Postgres/vector store can replace the sheet later; do not invent a live DB connection. No financial advice beyond generic budgeting.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "d1681165-f735-4289-934f-b8c9054a8bf4",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2014 Memory Layer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "CREDENTIALS NEEDED (pick/create on import \u2014 no credential is set in this file):\n- Google Sheets (OAuth2) \u2014 Update Sheet Dashboard, Read This Week's Transactions, Save Weekly Draft, Log Error to Sheet, Log Execution, Log Weekly Execution\n- Slack API \u2014 Flag Unusual Spend, Notify on Error\n- Telegram API \u2014 Send Approval Request\n- Gmail (OAuth2) \u2014 Send Weekly Summary Email (to sivasaiboggu@gmail.com)\n- Google Gemini (PaLM) API \u2014 Gemini Chat Model, Gemini Chat Model (Weekly)\n- No bank/Stripe credential \u2014 transactions arrive via webhook payload only",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "09b9afae-5519-4fbe-a237-115d3b40b475",
      "name": "Sticky Note \u2014 Credentials",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "finance-transaction",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "f8d8f3bf-394f-4275-be10-56cdc8604c79",
      "name": "Webhook \u2014 Transaction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "if (typeof $json.amount !== 'number') throw new Error('Transaction needs a numeric amount');\nreturn [{ json: { amount: $json.amount, currency: $json.currency || 'INR', merchant: $json.merchant || '', description: $json.description || '', date: $json.date || $now.toISO() } }];"
      },
      "id": "5d1ec198-2769-4e92-ac80-2ac25812d94a",
      "name": "Validate Transaction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gemini-2.0-flash",
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "b37aecda-b1f1-449a-baf4-e7d3a31c8878",
      "name": "Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Categorise this transaction into one of: Food, Transport, Subscriptions, Shopping, Bills, Income, Other. Transaction: {{ $json }}. Flag unusual_spend=true only if the amount is far above Siva's usual spend for that category (use the sheet history if supplied). Return JSON: {category, unusual_spend, reason}. Generic budgeting only \u2014 no personal financial advice.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You categorise transactions. You give generic budgeting observations only \u2014 never personal financial advice, investment advice or recommendations."
        }
      },
      "id": "3ede276c-7748-434d-88da-8d715cf1dbfe",
      "name": "Categorise Transaction (Gemini Agent)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.8,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.unusual_spend }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true
      },
      "id": "f9969e54-c3b2-4531-8d92-9797c82eed62",
      "name": "Unusual Spend?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "postMessage",
        "channel": "YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID",
        "text": "=Unusual spend flagged: {{ $json.merchant }} \u2014 {{ $json.amount }} {{ $json.currency }} ({{ $json.category }}). Reason: {{ $json.reason }}. No money was moved; this is an alert only.",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "bcc8373b-61bc-453a-81ae-03e73a99723a",
      "name": "Flag Unusual Spend (Slack)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": "YOUR_FINANCE_SHEET_ID",
        "sheetName": "Transactions",
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "date": "={{ $json.date }}",
            "merchant": "={{ $json.merchant }}",
            "amount": "={{ $json.amount }}",
            "currency": "={{ $json.currency }}",
            "category": "={{ $json.category }}",
            "unusual": "={{ $json.unusual_spend }}"
          }
        }
      },
